# Target C: close the nine-no-root k=4, D=-1, d_root=0, p=2 branch

Date: 2026-09-29

Status: proof-level composition of the committed support narrowing and the exact orientation certificates for all thirteen support orbits. This closes the two-selected-singleton subprofile. Together with the already-committed selected-pair closure, it closes the full `D=-1,p=2` branch of the nine-no-root `k=4` layer.

No new finite search is claimed by this note. The computational inputs are the persisted exact verifiers cited below, each with its own fail-closed census and execution record.

